      "width": 520,
      "height": 320,
      "data": {
        "title": "Invariants",
        "body": "Every entry contains, in this order, Meaning, Invariants, Contract, Ports and Relationships, Behavior, Known gaps, Representations, Explicitly Not Part of This Primitive, Examples, and Where this lives. Keep a section even when its answer is that no independent behavior exists. Preserve semantic IDs and durable addresses. Classify semantic responsibility independently from node, edge, chain or composed-graph encoding.",
