      "width": 520,
      "height": 320,
      "data": {
        "title": "Contract",
        "body": "Meaning states semantic responsibility and encoding. Invariants state agreed constraints. Contract names authored data without inventing runtime fields. Ports describes relationships. Behavior states what is implemented. Known gaps states what is not, and any question still open. Where this lives names the source files and the tests. Representations describes how it is shown. Boundary excludes nearby meanings. Examples link real graph artifacts through Page Routes.",
