      "data": {
        "title": "Known gaps",
        "body": "No structural checker proves prose correctness, external publication, live fetching or browser behavior. Runtime gaps remain linked to tasks. All sixteen specs share one encoding, a page built from the Page Template; a spec’s prose may still describe behavior the app has since changed.",
